(2. The Memory Hierarchy Pyramid) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
0 -25 Td
(Levels, Access Times & Typical Capacities) Tj
ET
50 500 m 750 500 l S
BT
/F2 11 Tf
50 470 Td
(Level 0 - CPU Internal Registers : 0.25 - 0.5 ns | ~1 KB | Compiler Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 1 - L1 Cache \(I-Cache/D-Cache\) : 0.5 - 1.5 ns | 32-128 KB | Hardware Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 2 - L2 Cache \(Per Core\) : 3.0 - 7.0 ns | 256KB-1MB | Hardware Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 3 - L3 Shared Cache : 10 - 25 ns | 8 - 64 MB | Hardware Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 4 - Main Memory \(DRAM\) : 50 - 80 ns | 8 - 64 GB | OS & Hardware Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 5 - Solid-State Drive \(SSD\) : 10 - 50 us | 512GB - 2TB | File System Managed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Level 6 - Cloud & Tertiary Archival : >100 ms | Unlimited | Distributed Storage) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F2 9 Tf
0 -40 Td
(Digital Logic and Computer Organization -- DLCO Seminar Portal) Tj
